{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "aacc6515a786da990788cdbb3e08258caa5696f2feb89272f19fef5259030495", "ja": "（亜利沙の、ハロウィンステージが終わった！\nせっかくなので仮装パレードに参加してみたが……）", "zh": "（亚利沙的万圣节表演结束了！\n由于机会难得，我们一起参加了变装游行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "b0b3526fa4dbef45cd69a499dc416804bd7c0801855ae01a21a7536c48e40742", "ja": "ひっ、ひええええ～っ！？\n{$P$}さん、ぞ、ゾンビが！？", "zh": "咿、咿呀～～～～！？\n{$P$}先生，有、有僵尸！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "e2f0b705e7296639cb16336272a1abf7f5d98431aadd4883667a66c96c3d8db4", "ja": "ああっ、あっちには幽霊に、ガイコツまで……！\nやぁ～んっ！　みなさん、リアルすぎますよ～っ！！", "zh": "啊！那边有幽灵，连骸骨都……！\n不要啊～！大家都扮得好逼真喔～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0b415f99a80de5c7ec8c7cca2089a40ebe0bc99c5d7afe5c5d48361a2d951a83", "ja": "亜利沙、後ろに隠れてないで前に出ないと……\n一応、アイドルとして参加しているわけだから。", "zh": "亚利沙，别一直躲在我后面，站前面点……\n你好歹也是以偶像身分来参加的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "b051897a2013e41520c61bd1c1af5ae7a3e6b937c6027aef1a8d899d8ebe4773", "ja": "わ、わかってますけど……。\nありさ本当は、ホラー系は苦手なんですよぉ～！", "zh": "话、话是这么说……\n可是亚利沙真的很怕吓人的东西啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e84a825c9c7aac4283dcb4692bb6c9f895e87a9f4cbae34460b754c68974abac", "ja": "さっきのライブは、平気そうだったじゃないか。\nたくさんのゾンビに囲まれて……。", "zh": "刚才在演唱会上被许多僵尸包围的时候，\n你不是一点都不怕吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "d0b0a4b35695f98b93e14b404511572f3fe73ba6122d9d716ddd532ff1e9027a", "ja": "ファンのみなさんは別ですっ。そりゃあ、\nみんなに楽しんでもらいたいって思いますケド……。", "zh": "粉丝们另当别论！\n而且亚利沙那时是希望大家能玩得尽兴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "93fbafad4b2f1ffae68b12c6828194c95f3e6fe706c01d92a765c43f8af996d2", "ja": "でも、ここのオバケのみなさんは、\nひょっとしたら本物かもしれませんし……ひい～！？", "zh": "可是，这边说不定有\n真的鬼怪混在里面啊……咿～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6ba5457f8b9db32b6ed20ef7cda93d9360fa13d97f61eb77c32ef59a0ffd3b73", "ja": "そんなことないぞ！　ここにいるみなさんは、\n本物のオバケとかじゃなくて……。", "zh": "没那回事！\n这里的鬼怪不是真正的鬼怪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5910ee25ae0305a454bb3df81b024ed15900b13eaa09ea429ac07b04352df2c6", "ja": "ファンになってくれるかもしれないオバケだって、\nそう考えればいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "而是有机会成为你的粉丝的鬼怪，\n只要这样想就好多了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "ed5c0fbd6b9740378489dd2001f406f7c87eb6de16b52d1d66e855937d110f9a", "ja": "はっ！　……た、確かに！\nありさ、意識が低かったカモ……！", "zh": "啊！这、这么说也是！\n亚利沙的心态还有待改进……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "86de0d8d5a753f6b66240943e99a99b0b828f3e569e804fcf57b73c0211c4300", "ja": "今はファンじゃなくても、いつか、\nファンになってくれるかもしれないみなさん……。", "zh": "就算现在不是粉丝，\n今后或许也有机会成为粉丝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "836508a901cda1a43d2b0bca1114d12832da88ff39daa402e9c2f5cd0cf9838f", "ja": "アイドルちゃんなら、そんな未来のファンの\nみなさんにも、笑顔を見せないとダメですよねっ！", "zh": "如果是偶像宝贝，\n在将来的粉丝们面前不拿出笑容来怎么行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1013_p", "source_sha256": "889834df2d86d6381683bef8894277ad9605f2febc9ac65142f4dceaf48b16eb", "ja": "ああ、そうだな！", "zh": "没错，就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "0d0d1715c331da9227d8f1a9a3128de30289b9f65e234f250288354f7430daba", "ja": "わかりました！　まだちょっと怖いですケド、\nちゃんと前に出てトリックオアトリートを……。", "zh": "好吧！虽然亚利沙还有点害怕，\n还是会到前面去不给糖就捣蛋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "4e8e141b9f37807bbc4b2489d6816e9c52b70d8c48e780b628af9b6670413297", "ja": "ふ、ふぉぉぉぉーっ！？", "zh": "唔、唔喔喔喔喔──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "64d0301c535217437b0a1aecbd05b431e6154578c171b0eace7cc112677351a8", "ja": "なんだ！？　今度はどうした！", "zh": "怎么了！？这次又发生了什么事！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "c212a7d1d567d6a3907166a87f9d720474088c934db0924e97d0b6fbaba53141", "ja": "{$P$}さん、あれ見てください！\nあっちにいる、仮装した一団！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，请你看那边！\n那边的变装团体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4e5e4665818610d16bdcd051e8831fc57fa2a16fa8ccdfc8472045f560cad5f4", "ja": "えっと……ああ、あれか。\nかなり本格的な仮装だな……怖いか？", "zh": "我看看……喔，那群人吗？\n她们的变装好用心……你觉得可怕吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "e2a7eb36abd678dba39a743420f373d009cac71c46265de66d8ce4065a2fb4a6", "ja": "何を言っているんですか！？　あれは、\n今をときめくアイドルちゃんグループですよ！！", "zh": "什么可怕！？\n她们是现在当红的偶像宝贝团体啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c05eaca7973a615cb5dd86a8dcbe21afaa32b4d06319c812186abf66a54eb235", "ja": "えっ？　あ、ああ……言われてみれば、見覚えが。\nけど、メイクをしているのによくわかったな……。", "zh": "什么？喔、喔喔……经你这么一说，我的确有印象。\n可是，她们明明化了万圣节妆，真亏你认得出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "8b7f4694ecaecf92eea7d2fbd6396327dc80b500f9a99b655e65bfd95f6789c0", "ja": "ムフーッ！　ありさアンテナ、感度バッチリです！\nあれくらいの仮装なら、見破れますよ～！", "zh": "唔呼──！亚利沙天线的讯号绝佳！\n当然看得穿那种程度的变装～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "6f1b09106bf538a4e50919a5471353bc2d4b81144af6bab95a371e7cac48d106", "ja": "これはぜひぜひ、ファンとしてお近づきに……。\nおおっ！？ではなく！　あの……そう、同業者として！", "zh": "身为粉丝，一定要趁这机会去亲近……\n喔喔！？不对！那个……对了，同行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "271ebfcebfe55193a3dccd45d67147085a3649aeb81c7652900e4adc88fef5bd", "ja": "あくまで同業者として、\nありさ、ちょっと挨拶してきますねっ！　ムフフフ♪", "zh": "单纯以偶像同行的身分，\n亚利沙要去打声招呼！唔呼呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0084_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9fad060bc8cbcdde6e73e7e4f8c3efc8dd5642f146712c3f7aeb9bbe37e8ac5e", "ja": "（亜利沙のプロ意識の片りんのようなものが、\nほんの一瞬だけでも見られて良かったな……うん！）", "zh": "（哪怕只有一瞬间，能看到亚利沙展现专业的一面，\n我就已经心满意足了……嗯！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
